(6902780, 1040681, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ambitious! ...and no doubt successful. See you on the front page! :)</td>', 'Ambitious! ...and no doubt successful. See you on the front page! :)', '2012-11-09 02:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902790, 1040623, 49109, '<td valign="top">Can''t find the original image.</td>', 'Can''t find the original image.', '2012-11-09 03:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902794, 1040589, 49109, '<td valign="top">Basically a good shot, but there are many significant differences to the original (color/bw, square crop/landscape crop, border/no border, deeper DOF/shallower DOF, dark book cover/bright book cover, nose invisible/visible, plain background/shaded background). Hair color you couldn''t have changed of course. <br/>Also, the eye seems to be dodged a bit much.</td>', 'Basically a good shot, but there are many significant differences to the original (color/bw, square crop/landscape crop, border/no border, deeper DOF/shallower DOF, dark book cover/bright book cover, nose invisible/visible, plain background/shaded background). Hair color you couldn''t have changed of course. Also, the eye seems to be dodged a bit much.', '2012-11-09 03:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902796, 1040656, 49109, '<td valign="top">Not sure if found the original image. It has some slight similarities with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52549" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">IreneM</a>s image "Lying in a puddle", but IMO not enough to be considered a Déja Vu.</td>', 'Not sure if found the original image. It has some slight similarities with  IreneMs image "Lying in a puddle", but IMO not enough to be considered a Déja Vu.', '2012-11-09 03:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902802, 1040647, 49109, '<td valign="top">Ok, it''s a tulip with water drops on black background, but that''s where the similarities end.<br/>First of all, your image lacks the simplicity and elegance of the original - mostly due to the excessive border, but also due to the higher contrast; Your lighting is quite different directionwise; the aspect ratio and the single leaf going  into the opposite direction to the stem makes the overall composition of the original much more pleasing.</td>', 'Ok, it''s a tulip with water drops on black background, but that''s where the similarities end.First of all, your image lacks the simplicity and elegance of the original - mostly due to the excessive border, but also due to the higher contrast; Your lighting is quite different directionwise; the aspect ratio and the single leaf going  into the opposite direction to the stem makes the overall composition of the original much more pleasing.', '2012-11-09 03:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902806, 1040650, 49109, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this lacks all the class Deb''s original has. Why didn''t you try it in color at the least? Why no tears?</td>', 'Unfortunately this lacks all the class Deb''s original has. Why didn''t you try it in color at the least? Why no tears?', '2012-11-09 03:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902813, 1040485, 49109, '<td valign="top">has some similarities with Jason''s image, but not enough to be considered a Déja Vu. You couldn''t possibly influence the clouds, but could at least have composed the shot in the same way (person at right third). Also, the most valuable aspect of the original is the water reaching to the lower edge of the image and the resulting reflection of sky and child.</td>', 'has some similarities with Jason''s image, but not enough to be considered a Déja Vu. You couldn''t possibly influence the clouds, but could at least have composed the shot in the same way (person at right third). Also, the most valuable aspect of the original is the water reaching to the lower edge of the image and the resulting reflection of sky and child.', '2012-11-09 03:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902814, 1040649, 49109, '<td valign="top">Recognizable even without the image title. Good lighting, color is close enough. However, crop and DOF are quite different, POV is a bit to low.</td>', 'Recognizable even without the image title. Good lighting, color is close enough. However, crop and DOF are quite different, POV is a bit to low.', '2012-11-09 04:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902815, 1040680, 49109, '<td valign="top">Dang, I also tried that but didn''t succeed. Your''s is almost perfect (should be flipped horizontally).</td>', 'Dang, I also tried that but didn''t succeed. Your''s is almost perfect (should be flipped horizontally).', '2012-11-09 04:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902819, 1040454, 49109, '<td valign="top">Thank you for chosing my image, much appreciated :)<br/>You did a very good job here, I''d say the image is easily recognizable for other viewers, too.<br/>However, there is a difference (color of the flower aside): the surface seems to be a mirror, not a black material - the reflection is as clear as the original object and even the water (as opposed to my image) has a distinct reflection. Lighting is a bit less directional but more even.<br/>Anyway, the best so far.</td>', 'Thank you for chosing my image, much appreciated :)You did a very good job here, I''d say the image is easily recognizable for other viewers, too.However, there is a difference (color of the flower aside): the surface seems to be a mirror, not a black material - the reflection is as clear as the original object and even the water (as opposed to my image) has a distinct reflection. Lighting is a bit less directional but more even.Anyway, the best so far.', '2012-11-09 04:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902820, 1040604, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but you have given me no clues as to whose shot this is!</td>', 'Lovely shot, but you have given me no clues as to whose shot this is!', '2012-11-09 04:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902823, 1040672, 114285, '<td valign="top">7541 is a different shot maybe you left a number out, still great action shot!</td>', '7541 is a different shot maybe you left a number out, still great action shot!', '2012-11-09 04:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902824, 1040683, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah this is wonderfully like the original. I like this style of still life.</td>', 'Oh yeah this is wonderfully like the original. I like this style of still life.', '2012-11-09 04:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902825, 1040640, 114285, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, not too bad, better than what I could come up with.</td>', 'Oh yeah, not too bad, better than what I could come up with.', '2012-11-09 04:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902826, 1040007, 114285, '<td valign="top">Purrrfectttttttt~~</td>', 'Purrrfectttttttt~~', '2012-11-09 04:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902827, 1040600, 114285, '<td valign="top">Ha great take off, thankyou!</td>', 'Ha great take off, thankyou!', '2012-11-09 04:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902829, 1040088, 49109, '<td valign="top">Thanks for choosing one of my image, very flattering :)<br/>You did a nice job here, however, I''d like  to point out where you missed the mark (difference in flower put aside):<br/>- light on the flower is from above front left instead of front right; <br/>- the orange light on the backdrop is totally missing;<br/>I guess you didn''t have access to the proper lighting equipment (or did you just not read my comments under the image?)<br/>- crop is not square<br/>- top of image is too dark<br/>- you could have cloned out some of the imperfections</td>', 'Thanks for choosing one of my image, very flattering :)You did a nice job here, however, I''d like  to point out where you missed the mark (difference in flower put aside):- light on the flower is from above front left instead of front right; - the orange light on the backdrop is totally missing;I guess you didn''t have access to the proper lighting equipment (or did you just not read my comments under the image?)- crop is not square- top of image is too dark- you could have cloned out some of the imperfections', '2012-11-09 04:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902831, 1040683, 49109, '<td valign="top">Really good work, that''s what I call a Déja Vu.<br/>Only nitpicks would be the slightly cooler white balance here along with the slightly reduced saturation.</td>', 'Really good work, that''s what I call a Déja Vu.Only nitpicks would be the slightly cooler white balance here along with the slightly reduced saturation.', '2012-11-09 04:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902833, 1040048, 114285, '<td valign="top">lol, that''s all I can say!</td>', 'lol, that''s all I can say!', '2012-11-09 05:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902834, 1040613, 49109, '<td valign="top">Brave. Where''s your dress?<br/>Excellent emulation (model and dress aside), just a tad less elegant, mostly due to the difference in head position and the smaller scarf.</td>', 'Brave. Where''s your dress?Excellent emulation (model and dress aside), just a tad less elegant, mostly due to the difference in head position and the smaller scarf.', '2012-11-09 05:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902837, 1040080, 114285, '<td valign="top">I wish you included the ID of the photo!</td>', 'I wish you included the ID of the photo!', '2012-11-09 05:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902838, 1040653, 49109, '<td valign="top">Very good attempt, though the lighting is different the composition is almost the same</td>', 'Very good attempt, though the lighting is different the composition is almost the same', '2012-11-09 05:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902841, 1040651, 114285, '<td valign="top">aghh you should of ironed the fabric before the shoot. Samantha''s shot is fully ironed, so it seems, still pretty good job, better than what I could of done, but then again I would not of done anything like this, oh maybe I should just stop talking :)</td>', 'aghh you should of ironed the fabric before the shoot. Samantha''s shot is fully ironed, so it seems, still pretty good job, better than what I could of done, but then again I would not of done anything like this, oh maybe I should just stop talking :)', '2012-11-09 05:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902843, 1040681, 49109, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, even more appealing than the original (at least for male viewers) only nitpick would be the color of background.</td>', 'Excellent work, even more appealing than the original (at least for male viewers) only nitpick would be the color of background.', '2012-11-09 05:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902844, 1040661, 49109, '<td valign="top">Thanks for choosing my image, I''m flattered :)<br/> <br/>Very well done in terms of lighting and overall mood, could just be a tad brighter.<br/>Missing border might be a matter of taste, but I wonder why you flipped the subject?<br/>Also looks like you used a bit much denoising.</td>', 'Thanks for choosing my image, I''m flattered :) Very well done in terms of lighting and overall mood, could just be a tad brighter.Missing border might be a matter of taste, but I wonder why you flipped the subject?Also looks like you used a bit much denoising.', '2012-11-09 05:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902845, 1040671, 49109, '<td valign="top">A good shot, you achieved to recreate the exact mood. However, DOF and composition are quite different as your lens was too wide.</td>', 'A good shot, you achieved to recreate the exact mood. However, DOF and composition are quite different as your lens was too wide.', '2012-11-09 05:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902846, 1040629, 49109, '<td valign="top">Easily recognizable, but not as good as the original, especially in terms of exposure ad POV</td>', 'Easily recognizable, but not as good as the original, especially in terms of exposure ad POV', '2012-11-09 05:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902847, 1040590, 49109, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but not as close to the original as I wished for, seems to be a different species of mushroom. Also crop is closer and the shallow DOF leads to a lack in detail, which is the essence of e301''s shot</td>', 'Good shot, but not as close to the original as I wished for, seems to be a different species of mushroom. Also crop is closer and the shallow DOF leads to a lack in detail, which is the essence of e301''s shot', '2012-11-09 05:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902850, 1040007, 49109, '<td valign="top">Almost as close as it gets, considered this is not Squeak. Only DOF in Yanko''s image was deeper (nose was fully in focus, neck almost).</td>', 'Almost as close as it gets, considered this is not Squeak. Only DOF in Yanko''s image was deeper (nose was fully in focus, neck almost).', '2012-11-09 05:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902852, 1040640, 49109, '<td valign="top">Obvious, even without the title, of which shot this is a remake. Composition is almost spot on, but you didn''t achieve what the original had: implying fast motion without having the brush blurred - not saying your brush is blurred, it''s just that the combination of brush and light looks more natural - must be the tilted view and a longer exposure with more than one light streak.</td>', 'Obvious, even without the title, of which shot this is a remake. Composition is almost spot on, but you didn''t achieve what the original had: implying fast motion without having the brush blurred - not saying your brush is blurred, it''s just that the combination of brush and light looks more natural - must be the tilted view and a longer exposure with more than one light streak.', '2012-11-09 05:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902853, 1040651, 49109, '<td valign="top">Well done in terms of lighting and composition, not so much in terms of model and props. Using Samantha or a Barbie doll as a model makes a huge difference :)</td>', 'Well done in terms of lighting and composition, not so much in terms of model and props. Using Samantha or a Barbie doll as a model makes a huge difference :)', '2012-11-09 05:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902856, 1040648, 49109, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot for itself, obviously not very close to John''s shot (subject aside, in your shot: POV higher and more frontal, cool toning, more sharpening, more detail in the shadows, deeper DOF)</td>', 'Excellent shot for itself, obviously not very close to John''s shot (subject aside, in your shot: POV higher and more frontal, cool toning, more sharpening, more detail in the shadows, deeper DOF)', '2012-11-09 06:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902863, 1040687, 49109, '<td valign="top">Same building, different crop or POV, different colors (probably different time of day). Overall good shot, not overwhelming, though.</td>', 'Same building, different crop or POV, different colors (probably different time of day). Overall good shot, not overwhelming, though.', '2012-11-09 06:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902868, 1040613, 103032, '<td valign="top">Whoa! too much cleavage.  Scooter has more of the classic Audrey Hepburn allure.  Smardaz has more of the smardaz scowl.<br/> <br/>Haha. Has me lol.  Nice effort :)</td>', 'Whoa! too much cleavage.  Scooter has more of the classic Audrey Hepburn allure.  Smardaz has more of the smardaz scowl. Haha. Has me lol.  Nice effort :)', '2012-11-09 06:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902877, 1040629, 108069, '<td valign="top">This isn''t even close! He was wearing shoes!<br/> <br/>Hell of a job. Well done.</td>', 'This isn''t even close! He was wearing shoes! Hell of a job. Well done.', '2012-11-09 07:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
