(6902963, 1040681, 109387, '<td valign="top">This would have been my second choice, but I chose another one... surely much better with a beautiful model/photographer :)</td>', 'This would have been my second choice, but I chose another one... surely much better with a beautiful model/photographer :)', '2012-11-09 09:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902964, 1040683, 109387, '<td valign="top">What a job! Great still life and VERY similar to the original!</td>', 'What a job! Great still life and VERY similar to the original!', '2012-11-09 09:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6903011, 1040411, 49109, '<td valign="top">I remembered that image in an instant (it''s not so long ago, though). Your POV is a bit too high and your lighting is a bit soft compared to the original, also from a slightly lower angle, which made the shadows of the tines merge and made it necessary to have a wider aspect ration. Overall quite well done for this challenge.</td>', 'I remembered that image in an instant (it''s not so long ago, though). Your POV is a bit too high and your lighting is a bit soft compared to the original, also from a slightly lower angle, which made the shadows of the tines merge and made it necessary to have a wider aspect ration. Overall quite well done for this challenge.', '2012-11-09 10:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6903012, 1040674, 49109, '<td valign="top">I guess you went for humor points here. Cute image for itself, but for the challenge it doesn''t work, only similarity is the composition.</td>', 'I guess you went for humor points here. Cute image for itself, but for the challenge it doesn''t work, only similarity is the composition.', '2012-11-09 10:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6903016, 1040604, 49109, '<td valign="top">Very good shot for itself, especially the bw-conversion. Subject differs much from the original, starting with the less wide lens over to the tree, which is much stronger, and the lack of clouds - this seems to be a wildfire (making me guess whose entry it is). Looking at your image I don''t get the mood of loneliness, nature''s strength and persistence that I got from the original.</td>', 'Very good shot for itself, especially the bw-conversion. Subject differs much from the original, starting with the less wide lens over to the tree, which is much stronger, and the lack of clouds - this seems to be a wildfire (making me guess whose entry it is). Looking at your image I don''t get the mood of loneliness, nature''s strength and persistence that I got from the original.', '2012-11-09 10:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6903019, 1040357, 49109, '<td valign="top">not bad, but compared to Christophe''s image it lacks of DOF (I understand that few people own a MP-E 65 lens), clarity and saturation.</td>', 'not bad, but compared to Christophe''s image it lacks of DOF (I understand that few people own a MP-E 65 lens), clarity and saturation.', '2012-11-09 10:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
