(6903027, 1040328, 49109, '<td valign="top">Where''s the rays - did you crop them off? Seriously, all the mood of the original isn''t present here. Sometimes you have to step back to get the whole image.</td>', 'Where''s the rays - did you crop them off? Seriously, all the mood of the original isn''t present here. Sometimes you have to step back to get the whole image.', '2012-11-09 10:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
