(6903073, 1040648, 30861, '<td valign="top">Subject matter and location are very Jagaresque. In all respects except processing it would be easy to think this was his. But the processing''s a little too crunchy; he uses smoother, rounder tonalities on top of his contrast. He gets a lot of that by running a layer of "Glamor Glow" in Nik Color Efex Pro. You can also get close to it with a free Photoshop action called "Gothic Glow"... A 7 from me.</td>', 'Subject matter and location are very Jagaresque. In all respects except processing it would be easy to think this was his. But the processing''s a little too crunchy; he uses smoother, rounder tonalities on top of his contrast. He gets a lot of that by running a layer of "Glamor Glow" in Nik Color Efex Pro. You can also get close to it with a free Photoshop action called "Gothic Glow"... A 7 from me.', '2012-11-09 11:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6903078, 1040613, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh, JASON! Is she giving you grief for this? Dude, you don''t have the NECK for this shot :-)</td>', 'Oh, JASON! Is she giving you grief for this? Dude, you don''t have the NECK for this shot :-)', '2012-11-09 11:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
