(6903115, 1040687, 54446, '<td valign="top">An almost exact copy of Venser''s ony ribbon.  hmmm.  The color temp and tint are different, but to capture this image, one would have to stand in the exact same spot with the exact lens focal length and shot angle.    The building didn''t move in the interim, but the knowledge of where to stand would be known only to Venser.</td>', 'An almost exact copy of Venser''s ony ribbon.  hmmm.  The color temp and tint are different, but to capture this image, one would have to stand in the exact same spot with the exact lens focal length and shot angle.    The building didn''t move in the interim, but the knowledge of where to stand would be known only to Venser.', '2012-11-09 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
