(6905472, 1040680, 97225, '<td valign="top">My first reaction is that this is identical to the original. Now I''m off to have a look at that.<br/>Ha! How memories deceive us! I see that this is like a previous homage shot, and nothing like the original Bubbles in Blue. But as it has to emulate a ribbon winner it must be emulating Irene''s shot, and it does it well.</td>', 'My first reaction is that this is identical to the original. Now I''m off to have a look at that.Ha! How memories deceive us! I see that this is like a previous homage shot, and nothing like the original Bubbles in Blue. But as it has to emulate a ribbon winner it must be emulating Irene''s shot, and it does it well.', '2012-11-13 21:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
