(6907124, 1040575, 97225, '<td valign="top">Excellent emulation. The last image up for voting for me and one of the best.</td>', 'Excellent emulation. The last image up for voting for me and one of the best.', '2012-11-15 18:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907125, 1040629, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great job at recreating this ''stick-in-your-mind'' photo.</td>', 'Great job at recreating this ''stick-in-your-mind'' photo.', '2012-11-15 18:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907140, 1040671, 64446, '<td valign="top">A wider view, and yet you managed to get the same feel and hue from the original.</td>', 'A wider view, and yet you managed to get the same feel and hue from the original.', '2012-11-15 19:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907144, 1040088, 64446, '<td valign="top">Not a true macro, but the colors are right and pleasing.</td>', 'Not a true macro, but the colors are right and pleasing.', '2012-11-15 19:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907146, 1040654, 64446, '<td valign="top">I''d say you took a jmritz approach to mimic a bspurgeon style image. I kind of like it...</td>', 'I''d say you took a jmritz approach to mimic a bspurgeon style image. I kind of like it...', '2012-11-15 19:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907152, 1040411, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sorry I''ve waited so long to comment on this one, it''s been a rough week. :)<br/> <br/>It even looks like you got one of my forks -- I had to go count and see if I had them all! :)<br/> <br/>What I particularly like about this one is that the shadow doesn''t connect to the small end of the fork; that it''s left curling off by itself.<br/> <br/>How fun to have someone pick one of my photos!! Thanks so much -- and very nicely done!!</td>', 'Sorry I''ve waited so long to comment on this one, it''s been a rough week. :) It even looks like you got one of my forks -- I had to go count and see if I had them all! :) What I particularly like about this one is that the shadow doesn''t connect to the small end of the fork; that it''s left curling off by itself. How fun to have someone pick one of my photos!! Thanks so much -- and very nicely done!!', '2012-11-15 20:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907166, 1040671, 12611, '<td valign="top">AH yes. If memory serves me, the highest rated shot ever. Nice work picking this.</td>', 'AH yes. If memory serves me, the highest rated shot ever. Nice work picking this.', '2012-11-15 21:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907168, 1040048, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome take on this shot.</td>', 'Awesome take on this shot.', '2012-11-15 21:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907170, 1040681, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awesome work. This will ribbon for sure.</td>', 'Awesome work. This will ribbon for sure.', '2012-11-15 21:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6907173, 1040613, 12611, '<td valign="top">The irony of a practically neck-less man in the shot is fantastic(and I can say that, having very little neck myself.)<br/> <br/>(eta: I figured it out- its your daughter. at least she go her mom''s neck genes!<br/>sorry about the rambly comments, I hope I am right!)</td>', 'The irony of a practically neck-less man in the shot is fantastic(and I can say that, having very little neck myself.) (eta: I figured it out- its your daughter. at least she go her mom''s neck genes!sorry about the rambly comments, I hope I am right!)', '2012-11-15 21:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
