(6907438, 1040629, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tome:</b></div><hr/><i> If you jumped a bit higher, you would have had more light in certain parts of the shot :)<br/>I think you did a great job recreating gyaban''s work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was not the jumper :D<br/> <br/>The problem is what I explained in the image details: I have had bending problems. The exposure was ok but I was not able to increase the brightness because the sky showed a lot of noisy lines. <br/> <br/>A lot of little flaws are what makes the difference between Christophe and me :)</td>', 'Originally posted by tome: If you jumped a bit higher, you would have had more light in certain parts of the shot :)I think you did a great job recreating gyaban''s work.   I was not the jumper :D The problem is what I explained in the image details: I have had bending problems. The exposure was ok but I was not able to increase the brightness because the sky showed a lot of noisy lines.  A lot of little flaws are what makes the difference between Christophe and me :)', '2012-11-16 06:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
